ime Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Time_Ring_8a8c16.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula%20Egg\"><img alt=\"Tarantula Egg\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tarantula_Egg_6c32cf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm%20Fang\"><img alt=\"Carrion Worm Fang\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carrion_Worm_Fang_aa7396.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Vandura Rotworm Cave Surface\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"231\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vandura_Rotworm_Cave_Surface_60f178.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.8<br/>August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nIf you come from rookgaard to main and start off in Liberty Bay these rotworm caves are probably the best place to start off. If you are a sorcerer just grab your wand and hunt happily. If you are a druid you start with an earth damage rod, which means you can't kill the centipedes. This is a bit of a handicap when hunting here, but rotworms shouldn't be a problem. Knights and paladins can just skill a bit or hunt here perfectly.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Surface\">Surface</span></h2>\n<p>Above the caves, lurking about the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">sugar cane</a>, are numerous weak monsters:\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Surface Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Purple%29\"><img alt=\"Butterfly (Purple)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Butterfly_Purple_4bdd3e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20%28Purple%29\">Butterfly (Purple)</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Parrot\"><img alt=\"Parrot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parrot_f2c07a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Parrot\">Parrot</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">25</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flamingo\"><img alt=\"Flamingo\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flamingo_044f1e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Flamingo\">Flamingo</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">25</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>Downy Feather (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Seagull\"><img alt=\"Seagull\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Seagull_bfde69.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><