e-space: nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Poison Spider Shell (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wasp\"><img alt=\"Wasp\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wasp_0ca50d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Wasp\">Wasp</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">24</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">35</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">20 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span><br/>+ 2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> from Poison</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Honeycomb\">Honeycomb</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_floor\">First floor</span></h2>\n<p>Here is a map from this floor (although not complete):\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 140px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Vandura rotworm caves floor1\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"202\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vandura_rotworm_caves_floor1_53c26d.png\" width=\"140\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Even lower <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">Levels</a> can hunt here, the toughest Monster is the <a href=\"#/wiki/Centipede\">Centipede</a>. However, as there are plenty of these weak monsters spawning everywhere and quickly; be weary as you may get swarmed. \n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First Floor Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\"><img alt=\"Bug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bug_16f3b8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\">Bug</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">18</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">29</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">23 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-6× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Cherry\">Cherry</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></